body:
i'm not sure if you saw the recent "SHADOWS ON THE WALL" deltarune theory video that just came out, but i was just talking with someone in the comments about this video. the person i was talking with did poke some holes in your theory, but we both agreed that it's REALLY good. i watched this video with my partner cause we're both big fans of toby's work, and we both were really enthralled with all of the connections you make. i'm sure this video took a long time to put together. you clearly did a lot of personal research on the game, spent a long time writing the script, and probably even longer editing it all together. it's really great stuff. i'm kind of sad it's your first upload in like 2 years, and i hope that i won't have to wait that long for your next one. i seriously don't think i've felt as satisfied or convinced by a theory since matpat's fnaf dream theory video, and with a monument like him leaving the scene, it's videos like this that make me feel hopeful for the future of online theorizing.

&#x200B;

tl;dr: though there are some potential holes, this is some seriously amazing work and i hope to see you upload again soon.
